## Animation Migration

| Before | After |
|---|---|
| `.spring(response: 0.3, dampingFraction: 0.8)` | `DesignTokens.Animation.springResponse` / `.springDamping` |
| `.easeInOut(duration: 0.3)` (entrance) | `DesignTokens.Animation.entranceDuration` |
| `.easeInOut(duration: 0.2)` (exit) | `DesignTokens.Animation.exitDuration` |

## Per-File Checklist

- [ ] Typography: raw `.scaledFont(size:weight:)` → token where match exists
- [ ] Typography: `.textStyle(.*)` → token (legacy API)
- [ ] Typography: `.font(.system(...))` → `.scaledFont(...)` (critical anti-pattern)
- [ ] Remove orphaned `.tracking(...)` when token applies tracking
- [ ] Spacing: hardcoded values → `DesignTokens.Spacing.*` / `Layout.*`
- [ ] Corner radii → `DesignTokens.CornerRadius.*`
- [ ] Button metrics → `DesignTokens.ButtonMetrics.*`
- [ ] Hero image values → `DesignTokens.HeroImage.*` (detail screens)
- [ ] Animation timing → `DesignTokens.Animation.*`
- [ ] Shadow values → `DesignTokens.Shadow.*`
- [ ] Leave non-matching values as raw parameters
- [ ] Verify no lint errors introduced
